---
// pool_size=2, max_overflow=0, pool_timeout=1; three requests each hold a
// connection for 3 s. Numbers from the curl capture in the post.
const W = 900, H = 330;
---
<figure class="bep5d">
  <div class="bep5d-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Three requests on the left. A pool box with two connection slots in the middle, both busy. Requests 1 and 2 take the slots and reach the database on the right. Request 3 finds no free slot, waits 1 second and fails with a TimeoutError.">
    {[0, 1, 2].map((i) => (
      <g>
        <rect x="40" y={80 + i * 60} width="150" height="44" rx="8" class={i === 2 ? 'bad' : 'box'} />
        <text x="115" y={107 + i * 60} text-anchor="middle" class={i === 2 ? 'nm redt' : 'nm'}>
          <tspan data-lang-en>request {i + 1}</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>request {i + 1}</tspan>
        </text>
      </g>
    ))}
    <line x1="190" y1="102" x2="340" y2="102" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="350,102 340,97 340,107" class="hd" />
    <line x1="190" y1="162" x2="340" y2="162" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="350,162 340,157 340,167" class="hd" />
    <line x1="190" y1="222" x2="320" y2="222" class="bad" stroke-dasharray="6 4" />
    <line x1="320" y1="212" x2="336" y2="232" class="bad" />
    <line x1="320" y1="232" x2="336" y2="212" class="bad" />

    <rect x="350" y="44" width="260" height="210" rx="12" class="seam" />
    <text x="480" y="68" text-anchor="middle" class="nm mono">pool_size=2</text>
    {[0, 1].map((i) => (
      <g>
        <rect x="370" y={80 + i * 60} width="220" height="44" rx="8" class="box" />
        <text x="480" y={106 + i * 60} text-anchor="middle" class="sub">
          <tspan data-lang-en>connection {i + 1} · held 3 s</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>connection {i + 1} · giữ 3 s</tspan>
        </text>
      </g>
    ))}
    <text x="480" y="232" text-anchor="middle" class="sub">
      <tspan data-lang-en>no free slot · max_overflow=0</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>hết slot · max_overflow=0</tspan>
    </text>

    <line x1="590" y1="102" x2="730" y2="102" class="ln" />
    <line x1="590" y1="162" x2="730" y2="162" class="ln" />
    <line x1="730" y1="102" x2="730" y2="162" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="760,132 750,127 750,137" class="hd" />
    <line x1="730" y1="132" x2="752" y2="132" class="ln" />
    <rect x="760" y="104" width="110" height="56" rx="10" class="box" />
    <text x="815" y="137" text-anchor="middle" class="nm">
      <tspan data-lang-en>database</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>database</tspan>
    </text>

    <text x="40" y="300" class="sub">
      <tspan data-lang-en>requests 1 and 2: 200 after 3.0 s</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>request 1 và 2: 200 sau 3.0 s</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="400" y="300" class="redt">
      <tspan data-lang-en>request 3: 500 after 1.0 s (pool_timeout=1)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>request 3: 500 sau 1.0 s (pool_timeout=1)</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>A pool is a small, fixed set of open connections. When every one is busy, the next request queues for pool_timeout seconds, then fails. Slow work done while holding a connection is what drains it.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Pool là một tập nhỏ, cố định các connection đang mở. Khi hết sạch, request kế tiếp xếp hàng pool_timeout giây rồi báo lỗi. Làm việc chậm trong lúc đang giữ connection là thứ rút cạn pool.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .bep5d { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .bep5d-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .bep5d svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .bep5d text { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .bep5d .h { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 15px; }
  .bep5d .nm { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 14.5px; }
  .bep5d .sub { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .bep5d .mono { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 12.5px; }
  .bep5d .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .bep5d .seam { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; stroke-dasharray: 6 4; }
  .bep5d .good { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .bep5d .bad { fill: none; stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .bep5d .badfill { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep5d .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.6; fill: none; }
  .bep5d .hd { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .bep5d .redt { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .bep5d .goodt { fill: var(--gold-icon); font-weight: 700; }
  .bep5d figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
